開幕了，之前因為試營運都只有晚餐，中午來都撲空，2023.8.18終於開幕，連續兩天舉辦打一元好禮彈珠樂，我當然也就連兩天來了，啊為什麼我的彈珠都不下去啦？\n兩天吃了三種湯頭，個人都很喜歡，因為目前不吃牛，沒辦法吃到最厲害的炙燒培根牛加香蒜蛤蜊拉麵；個人最愛的是雞白湯拉麵，再來是豚骨，麻辣的嚴格來說就還好，唐揚雞蠻不賴的，胡麻豆腐很好吃，明太子叉燒飯也很讚，這店開在我公司附近，看來我得常常來搭伙了⋯⋯\n題外話：開幕慶在門口辦活動的店員很活潑，店內可能因為客人太多還沒辦法有時間露露笑臉，甚至昨天第一天我們上桌的餐點都吃完了，還有一碗豚骨拉麵漏了做，不過這都沒關係，希望可以越來越好，但是變得更好之後，請不要忘了熱情與笑容，我會更加喜愛！",null,[0,88]]]],[null,1692460398000000,1692460398000000,"3 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04RFlNZ05heTVrNE9WdUFBSk1GQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfQm04RFlNZ05heTVrNE9WdUFBSk1GQRoSQ2dzSTdzcURwd1lRak1ia1J3\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi1j8epytKWAxV5hagCHU4XLVMQ_2MIswEoKQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndPSE5VUjAxQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndPSE5VUjAxQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndPSE5VUjAxQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndPSE5VUjAxQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndPSE5VUjAxQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndPSE5VUjAxQkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝你的喜歡，讓拉麵美味是我們的使命，你的鼓勵是我們店繼續努力的動力，繼續鼓勵不要停哦~",null,[0,44]]]],[null,null,8886,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwOHNUR01BEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xb9a4bdc8cdaf80d4!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDp8sTGMA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwOHNUR01BEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9n