1j8epytKWAxV5hagCHU4XLVMQ3IcHCNwBKBM",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11whz05pwv"],"招牌豚骨拉麵",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi1j8epytKWAxV5hagCHU4XLVMQ3YcHCN4BKAA"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwi1j8epytKWAxV5hagCHU4XLVMQ3IcHCN0BKBQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["最近一直看到「麵匡匡」的店\n其實我是沒那麼愛吃拉麵店\n但這種冷冷的天氣\n不喜歡拉麵的我\n還是很喜歡來上一碗熱熱的湯麵\n感覺就是喝上一口\n就會很暖～很暖\n\n拉麵口味還蠻多的\n不過唐揚雞塊有讓我驚艷到\n就是被炸雞耽誤的拉麵店啊⋯⋯\n\n店內的乾辣椒一看就覺得好吃\n可惜我已經點了川味炙燒牛拉麵\n我這種微辣等級的\n已經覺得十分麻辣⋯\n\n招牌豚骨拉麵就是中規中矩的日式拉麵\n溏心蛋、叉燒肉、筍片、花椰菜、玉米筍⋯\n就跟圖片一模一樣\n\n還可以+60元升級套餐有A、B 、C三種\n飲料我推薦桂花紅茶\n蠻特別的\n有特別的桂花味\n\n下次有機會路過\n可以進去嚐嚐看💕",null,[0,35]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm1la2wxWWtObkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm1la2wxWWtObkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm1la2wxWWtObkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm1la2wxWWtObkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm1la2wxWWtObkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm1la2wxWWtObkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,5145,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmekl1YkNnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xb9a4bdc8cdaf80d4!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDfzIubCg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmekl1YkNnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmekl1YkNnEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGZ6SXVi