CKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwi1j8epytKWAxV5hagCHU4XLVMQ3IcHCI0CKBg",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["每次用餐時間經過時，店內總是爆滿的一家拉麵店，人氣指數挺高的！\n\n拉麵的選項挺豐富，牛肉或海鮮等主菜搭配玉米筍、綠花椰、溏心蛋、筍乾、蔥花等配料實在，捲麵跟擺盤配色等也具有美感；湯頭嚐起來濃郁而且可以自助再續加湯汁；麵條可以選擇推薦的細麵或嚼勁十足的粗麵，還能勾選偏好的軟硬度，這天同時試了軟麵或硬麵其實都不錯。單點料理的主推唐揚雞鮮，炸的香酥鮮嫩多汁，份量也算有誠意。\n\n店面裝潢乾淨明亮，座位不算多但不會太擠，主廚店員服務熱情，難怪如此人氣不墜！",null,[0,31]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlVjblZmWTJ4blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlVjblZmWTJ4blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlVjblZmWTJ4blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlVjblZmWTJ4blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlVjblZmWTJ4blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2062740030247851724/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlVjblZmWTJ4blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,7157,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUcnVfY2xnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb9a4bdc8cdaf80d4!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICTru_clgE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUcnVfY2xnRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUcnVfY2xnRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUcnVfY1ZnEhNDZ3dJdG8yUXNnWVE2TGZqcHdJGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ1RydV9jMWdFEhNDZ3dJdG8yUXNnWVE2TGZqcHdJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR1ICvzci9pLkqCzBhRy1QcVp5Q2pj\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi1j8epytKWAxV5hagCHU4XLVMQoykIjwIoGQ"],nu